R12D_H2NON_FIRST='jpg png gif webp bmp jxr psd dwg mp4 m4v mkv webm mov2 mov3 mov4 avi wmv flv 3gp mid mp3 mp3b m4a m4a2 ogg flac wav amr aac aac2 aiff'
